{
  "summary": "This experiment tested combining the scvi_n200 RNA encoder with ResNet50 image encoders using avgpool aggregation and concat fusion in a multimodal multiprofile setup. Validation accuracy (0.6315) and F1 (0.6068) are slightly lower than the RNA-only scvi_n200 baseline (0.6501), suggesting multimodal integration may not fully leverage the RNA encoder's strength. Uncertainty remains about the optimal fusion strategy and whether alternative aggregation methods or encoder combinations could improve performance."
}

